<item><title>Design, Supply, Construction, Testing and Commissioning of Solar PV System at Forbes STP</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking tenders from suitably qualified and experienced parties for the complete design and construction of a ground-mounted Solar Photovoltaic (PV) facility at the Forbes Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) within the Forbes Local Government Area (LGA).<br /><br />The Contractor shall provide all engineering, design, approvals support, procurement to deliver a fully operational solar PV system integrated with the existing electrical infrastructure. The completed facility shall be safe, compliant, fit-for-purpose and capable of long-term operation within a flood-prone environment.<br /><br />The proposed system shall comprise:<br /><br />(a)	Minimum 210kW DC solar PV capacity.<br /><br />(b)	Minimum 160kW AC inverter capacity.<br /><br />(c)	Ground-mounted solar array.<br /><br />(d)	New PV distribution board and associated protection systems.<br /><br />(e)	Monitoring and communications systems.<br /><br />(f)	Approximately 100m of security/livestock fencing.<br /><br />(g)	Elevated inverter access platf...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Forbes Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Dec/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534502<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
