<item><title>QED 6575 2026 - Jones Hill SS - SSS Multi Purpose Court (PQC eligibility contractors)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Please contact Andrew Harrison – Project Manager on andrew@honeywill.com.au with your company details and tender documentation will be emailed to contractors. Details of the site inspection will be advised in the email and letters to tenderers.<br /><br />The Department of Education (DoE) is calling for tender submissions for the design and construction of a SSS Multi-Purpose Court at Jones Hill SS, located at 21 McIntosh Creek Road, Jones Hill QLD 4570, as part of the Smart School Subsidy (SSS) program.<br /><br />The new sports court will be located to the rear of the school, conjoining the school sports fields. There is sufficient site access and good working area. All works are to be completed by May 2027.<br /><br />Tender submissions will be accepted from contractors that meet the following requirements:<br /><br />•	Appropriate QBCC Builders licences to undertake the entire scope of works<br /><br />•	Professional Indemnity Insurance to the value of $1,000,000.00<br /><br />Minimum PQC Level 2 Eligibil...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Education<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Dec/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534487<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
