<item><title>Civil, Landscaping and Lighting Works at Hazelbrook Town Centre</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Blue Mountains City Council invites tenders for RFT 2026/27-600013 – Civil, Landscaping and Lighting Works – Hazelbrook Town Centre. <br /><br />Council seeks a suitably qualified contractor to undertake the civil, landscape and lighting works associated with the Hazelbrook Town Centre activation, in accordance with the Request for Tender, drawings, specifications and contract documentation.<br /><br />The works will be undertaken within Hazelbrook Town Centre in the Blue Mountains local government area.<br /><br />The contractor is required to provide all labour, plant, materials, supervision, and management to complete the works in accordance with the design drawings, specifications, and relevant authority requirements. <br /><br />The contractors are expected to read through this Vendor Panel RF(x) where general information is presented, alongside with all uploaded documentation – attached to this Request for Tender.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Blue Mountains City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534342<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
