<item><title>TEN/3199 Alexandra Park Zoo Emu/Wallaby Enclosure Fence Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Project Overview<br /><br />Alexandra Park Zoo requires the replacement of the existing perimeter fence surrounding the Emu and Wallaby enclosure. The existing fence is nearing the end of its service life and is to be replaced with a new fence that maintains animal containment, improves durability and continues to meet relevant animal welfare and biosecurity requirements. The enclosure perimeter is approximately 140 linear metres.<br /><br />All works as per scope below will need to be completed by the 31/05/2027<br /><br />Site Inspection<br /><br />A site visit is recommended but not mandatory for prospective contractors to familiarize themselves with existing site conditions, access constraints, and the extent of the Works.<br /><br />Council will host a non compulsory site inspection on Monday 30/11/2026 at 9.30 am for 1hr meet at the 29 Quay St, corner Quay and Burrum Streets, Bundaberg West QLD 4670. Attendance at the site inspection is optional.<br /><br />Contractors wishing to attend the site inspect...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Bundaberg Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Dec/2026 08:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534218<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
