<item><title>CN-27950 - MIC-CO - Nicklin Way Asphalt Resurfacing, 4.24 - 5.89km</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads, North Coast Region, is seeking proposals for a Nicklin Way Resurfacing project. This contract is for the delivery of asphalt resurfacing along the Nicklin Way between Chainage, 4.24 - 5.89km.<br /><br />Contractors with TMR prequalification Major A3, Minor R2 and Financial F25 or above are invited to tender. <br /><br />Tenderers are advised the Queensland Code and Guidelines apply to this tender<br /><br />Only TMR prequalified eligible tenderers will be given access to the Tender Documents via the QBuild eTender website: https://etender.hpw.qld.gov.au/. Prequalified tenderers are to email NC_Procurement_Inbox@tmr.qld.gov.au to gain access to the tender documents.<br /><br />Tender submissions are only to be submitted electronically at https://etender.hpw.qld.gov.au. <br /><br />Technical Enquiries: <br /><br />Mathew Grey<br /><br />(07) 5452 1824<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads-North Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534467<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
