<item><title>Community Enterprise Qld: Invitation to Tender - Insurance Brokerage and Risk Management Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> CEQ's operating environment presents particular insurance and risk management challenges arising from its geographically dispersed operations, remote locations, exposure to severe weather and natural catastrophe events, supply chain dependencies and the need to maintain essential community services.<br /><br />CEQ maintains an insurance program covering its assets, operations, liabilities, personnel and other applicable risks. The current insurance program is managed through an appointed insurance broker.<br /><br />CEQ is seeking to appoint a suitably qualified and experienced insurance broker to provide comprehensive insurance brokerage, insurance program management, claims management and risk advisory services.<br /><br />The successful Tenderer will be responsible for providing professional, independent and commercially competitive advice to ensure CEQ maintains appropriate insurance coverage and achieves value for money.<br /><br />This Invitation to Tender has been prepared by Peak Services on behalf of...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Peak Services Procurement<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534191<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Peter Morichovitis Email: pmorichovitis@wearepeak.com.au Tel: 0480221578<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Financial & Insurance Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
