<item><title>Restoration Program - Sealed Roads</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Douglas Shire Council (DSC) invites Tenders from suitably qualified Tenderers for the construct-only restoration of sealed roads throughout the Douglas Shire Council local government area that were damaged as a result of the 29 January 2025 to 28 February 2025 event and are being delivered under Council's 2025 Disaster Recovery Funding Arrangements (DRFA) program. The Works include pavement rehabilitation and localised reconstruction, in-situ stabilisation, shoulder repairs, sprayed bituminous sealing, asphalt surfacing, line marking, stone pitching repairs, traffic management, environmental controls, quality assurance and associated reinstatement, as described in Part 5 - Scope.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Douglas Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534356<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
