<item><title>Maintenance and Technical Support - MTNS MADE Website</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Blue Mountains City Council (BMCC) is seeking the services of a consultant to host, maintain, support and further develop the Mtns Made website at: https://www.mtnsmade.com.au/<br /><br /><br />The MTNS MADE website is hosted separately. Each part of the platform runs on its provider’s own hosting:<br /><br />•	Webflow hosts the website<br /><br />•	Supabase hosts the database and server functions<br /><br />•	Memberstack runs member accounts<br /><br />•	Stripe handles payments<br /><br />The scope of service covers the following:<br /><br />Section 1. Regular activities<br /><br />Section 2. Annotated process screenshots of regular activities<br /><br />Section 3. Service availability for ad hoc projects<br /><br />Section 4. Other information<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Blue Mountains City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533908<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
