<item><title>Stormwater Diversion Drain and Drainage Crossings, Kondinin</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Shire of Kondinin invites quotations from suitably qualified and experienced civil contractors for the supply and installation of two stormwater drainage crossings in Kondinin.<br /><br />The works include the installation of two four-barrel crossings using 450 mm diameter reinforced concrete pipes, together with concrete headwalls, excavation, bedding, backfilling, pavement reinstatement and associated works.<br /><br />The crossings are located at:<br /><br />- De Largie Road, Kondinin; and<br /><br />- the Kondinin North CBH site access.<br /><br />The Shire will undertake the preparatory grading required to form the associated stormwater diversion drain.<br /><br />The Shire anticipates awarding the contract during December 2026. All works must achieve practical completion by 31 March 2027.<br /><br />A voluntary site visit will be held at 3:00 pm AWST on Thursday, 26 November 2026. Registration is required through VendorPanel by 4:00 pm AWST on Monday, 23 November 2026.<br /><br />Questions must be s...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Shire of Kondinin<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Dec/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534252<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
