<item><title>EOI - Secure Virtual Desktop Environment</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The University of Queensland (UQ) is planning to procure a secure, isolated virtual desktop environment for authorised researchers to conduct sensitive research projects.<br /><br />At this stage of the procurement process, UQ invites interested suppliers to submit their expression of interest. Responses will be assessed to identify suppliers that may be invited to participate in the subsequent procurement process.<br /><br />This expression of interest stage is a preliminary step in the procurement process. At this stage, UQ is primarily assessing market capability, solution suitability and credibility. UQ is not seeking detailed proposals, formal pricing, or binding offers at this stage.<br /><br />UQ anticipates releasing a tender in early December 2026, closing in mid-January 2027. UQ reserves the right to amend the schedule at its absolute discretion.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> The University of Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Nov/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP534222<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
