<item><title>EOI - Lease or Management of the Swan Hill Regional Livestock Exchange</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council (Council) invites expressions of interest (EOIs) from suitably qualified and experienced operators lease or manage the Swan Hill Regional Livestock Exchange.<br /><br />This opportunity allows proponents to build upon the facility’s strong foundations, enhance service delivery, and contribute to the continued growth of the regional livestock sector.<br /><br />Council welcomes proposals under the following three operational models:<br /><br />(a) Option 1 – Full Lease Arrangement (Preferred Option): The proponent assumes full operational responsibility and financial management of the SHRLE.<br /><br />(b) Option 2 – Proponent-Proposed Model: An alternative operating model or partnership arrangement proposed by the proponent.<br /><br />(c) Option 3 – Licensed Sale Day Access: Access to the facility on nominated sale days under a licensing arrangement.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 23/Dec/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531253<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Farming & Animal Services & Equip<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
