<item><title>ITT2619 - Digital Communications Products and Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking and end-to-end managed Digital Communications Products and Services to support current and future public-facing information, wayfinding and digital communication requirements across the Sunshine Coast region.<br /><br />The initial implementation comprises three public information kiosks at Aura. Respondents must propose and price at least one of the permitted hardware ownership models and may propose both where available. The arrangement will also provide a pathway for Council-approved future deployments and the potential transition of suitable existing assets.<br /><br />Council intends to appoint a single Lead Supplier responsible for the delivery and ongoing management of the service, including any subcontracted components.<br /><br />Detailed scope, service and technical requirements are contained in Schedule 5, Attachment 1, Project Brief.<br /><br />The term of the Contract will be five (5) years.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Dec/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533685<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms, Marketing & Communications<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 10]]></description>
