<item><title>2526-35 || New/Replacement Parking Meters - Supply and Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> City of Greater Dandenong invites tenders for Contract 2526-35 New/Replacement Parking Meters – Supply and Maintenance.<br /><br />Council is seeking suitably qualified suppliers for the supply, installation, replacement, retrofit and ongoing maintenance of parking payment equipment and associated technology across the City of Greater Dandenong.<br /><br />Solutions may include card-only parking meters, card and coin meters, retrofit options, digital payment alternatives and associated software and integration services.<br /><br />Tenderers may submit proposals for individual solution types and are not required to offer the full range.<br /><br />Council anticipates approximately 30 new or retrofitted meters and 30–40 replacement or partial-service interventions over an initial three-year purchasing period. These quantities are indicative only, with no guaranteed expenditure.<br /><br />Maintenance and support for equipment purchased under the arrangement may be required through to 29 December 2034.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Greater Dandenong<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533855<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Electronic Components & Supplies, IT & Telecomms, Parking, Traffic Services & Equip<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
