<item><title>ROI- Roma Street Connect Main Works Package</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Following the Forward Procurement Notice (FPN) released on 3 November 2026, this Invitation to submit a Registration of Interest (Invitation) is the first stage of the Procurement Process through which the Department of Transport and Main Roads (TMR) intends to engage a contractor to deliver the Main Works Package of the Project. The purpose of the Registration of Interest (ROI) Stage is to: provide information about the Project and the Main Works Package; outline the proposed Procurement Process for the Main Works Package, including indicative timeframes; and identify organisations that demonstrate to the satisfaction of TMR their capacity to meet the ROI Response Requirements as set out in section 5 to be invited to participate in the Expression of Interest (EOI) Stage.<br /><br />All enquiries in relation to this Invitation must be directed in writing to the Transaction Manager at RSC_Transaction@tmr.qld.gov.au. Registrants must not contact any other officer or representative of TMR, QR or the Key Advisors...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533843<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Railway, Tramway and Track<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
