<item><title>Bundaberg Greyhound Track Conversion Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Racing Queensland (RQ) invites Expressions of Interest (EOI) from suitably qualified and experienced contractors for the Bundaberg Greyhound Track Conversion Project.<br /><br />RQ is seeking a single Principal Contractor capable of managing and delivering all components of the project, including completion of the required design, track conversion, associated civil works, systems and technology installations, compliance requirements, and other supporting works and activities.<br /><br />This EOI forms Stage 1 of a two-stage procurement process:<br /><br />•	Stage 1 – Expression of Interest: RQ will assess contractor capability, capacity, availability and relevant experience to identify contractors suitable to progress to the next stage.<br /><br />•	Stage 2 – Request for Tender: RQ intends to shortlist up to five contractors from the EOI process to participate in a formal Request for Tender (RFT), anticipated to commence in January/February 2027.<br /><br />Participation in this EOI does not guarantee progres...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Racing Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533834<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
