<item><title>Construction works for Longreach Hospital Chillers Replacement Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Central West Hospital and Health Service (CWHHS) is seeking a suitably qualified and experienced mechanical services contractor to undertake the replacement of three existing air-cooled chillers at Longreach Hospital.<br /><br />The works include the removal of the existing chillers and the installation, integration, testing and commissioning of three Principal-supplied Carrier 30RBP-670R air-cooled scroll chillers.<br /><br />The successful contractor will be responsible for delivering all associated construction works required to provide a complete, fully operational and compliant chilled-water system. This includes coordinating the works within an operational hospital environment and minimising disruption to patients, staff and clinical services.<br /><br />Expected timing: Construction required to be completed by 30 June 2027<br /><br />Location: Longreach Hospital, Longreach, QLD, 4730<br /><br />Tenderers must refer to the project specifications and drawings for the Longreach Hospital Chiller Replacemen...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central West Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Dec/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533206<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Libbi Dolgner Email: libbi.dolgner@health.qld.gov.au Tel: 46528041<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
