<item><title>CTIS028 - 25/26 - Nature Assisted Beach Enhancement - NABE</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Fraser Coast Regional Council is inviting offers from suitably qualified and experienced Tenderers for Nature Assisted Beach Enhancement (NABE). <br /><br />Tenderers must demonstrate within their response to this Request for Tender that they can:<br /><br />•	Provide the machinery and personnel to perform NABE; and<br /><br />•	Perform NABE using a methodology which acknowledges the dynamic foreshore environment; and<br /><br />•	Perform NABE using a methodology which acknowledges the public nature of the foreshore environment.<br /><br /><br />SUBMISSION OF TENDER DOCUMENTS<br /><br />Please be advised that tender response forms are to be submitted as two (2) documents only and in the following format:<br /><br />- Non-Price Response Form: PDF including all supporting documentation as one (1) document. This PDF must not contain any price related criteria.<br /><br />- Price Response Form: Excel<br /><br />Failure to comply with this requirement may result in a non-conforming offer.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Fraser Coast Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Dec/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533733<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Environmental & Heritage Services, Marine Transp. Products & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
