<item><title>TEN/3200 Childers Service Centre Roof Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Background<br /><br />Bundaberg Regional Council seeks suitably qualified and experienced contractors to undertake the replacement of the roof and associated box gutters at the Childers Service Centre, 45 Churchill Street, Childers.<br /><br />The works comprise the replacement of approximately 280m² of existing corrugated metal roof sheeting, together with the replacement of existing box gutters and associated roof flashings.<br /><br />The building is a heritage-listed structure, and all works are to be undertaken in a manner that preserves and protect the heritage significance, character and architectural integrity of the building.<br /><br />This work will need to be completed by the 30 May 2027.<br /><br />WHS<br /><br />When submitting safety documentation with this RFQ, you are able to submit example of what you have done in the past as long it relates to the scope of works in the Vendor panel. <br /><br />If you have any questions about this please submit your questions via Vendor Panel. <br /><br />S...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Bundaberg Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Dec/2026 08:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533567<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
