<item><title>Bayview Park Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council invites Tenders to undertake Works as specified for the construction of a playground and car parking upgrade at 124 Bayview Road LAUDERDALE TAS 7021. Detailed design drawings and specification are set out in Attachment No. 1 and Attachment No. 2.<br /><br />Full details are provided in Schedule 1 of the specimen copy of the Contract appearing in Part 4 of this Invitation. Tenderers are to contact Council’s nominated contact officer named on the cover page if additional information is required to submit the Tender.<br /><br />BACKGROUND<br /><br />Clarence City Council is inviting tenders for the construction of a playground and carparking upgrade at 124 Bayview Road, Lauderdale. Bayview Park is a small local park on the northern/ beach side of Bayview Road with an area of around 2700m². The park currently has basic play equipment and picnic facilities that have reached the end of their serviceable life. There is also an existing kayak washdown area, outdoor change room facility and a recently renewed ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Clarence<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Hobart time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533699<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
