<item><title>ITT2550 - Sports Field Construction Packages - Honey Farm Road Sports Precinct</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council is seeking experienced contractors for the construction of 3 x soccer and 2 x cricket turf sports fields and associated works. The site is located within Council’s Honey Farm Road Sports Precinct, 4 Honey Farm Road, Meridan Plains.<br /><br />The scope of work will include, but not be limited to:<br /><br />1.	Separable Portion 1 - Construction of 3 x turf soccer fields<br /><br />2.	Separable Portion 2 - Construction of 2 x turf cricket fields.<br /><br />Construction activities include:<br /><br />·	Construction of turf fields, surrounds and access<br /><br />·	Perimeter security<br /><br />·	Survey of subgrade prior to handover and site possession<br /><br />·	Importing of materials to site<br /><br />·	Safe storage of materials on site<br /><br />·	Fenced construction compound<br /><br />·	Full rectification of any damaged surfaces – geotechnical approval of rectifications<br /><br />·	Disposal of all waste materials<br /><br />·	Full RPEQ certification of works<br /><br />·	Survey ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Dec/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533614<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 23]]></description>
