<item><title>TRC000544 Supply of High Voltage Asset Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking tenders from suitably experienced companies for ongoing implementation of a maintenance program for its High Voltage (HV) Assets listed in the HV Asset List and Schedule of Rates spreadsheet. Council has a requirement to ensure these are adequately maintained in accordance with relevant legislation and industry best practice. Council is committed to providing reliable essential services, and these HV assets are essential to the operation of parts of the water and wastewater networks that Council operates. The primary aim of this contract is to ensure Council has sufficient expertise and capacity to call upon to deliver this service for HV assets.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533524<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
