<item><title>TEN16850 - Provision of Washroom and Trade Waste Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Rockhampton Regional Council are seeking written submissions to conduct Washroom and Trade Waste Servicing at various Rockhampton Regional Council sites. <br /><br />The tender is divided into 2 portions of works. Contractors may submit offers for one, or both portions. Council has the right to award the portions to separate Contractors. <br /><br />	Portion 1 – Washroom Services<br /><br />a)	Sanitary Napkin Disposal<br /><br />b)	Nappy Disposal<br /><br />c)	Sharps Containers<br /><br />Portion 2 – Trade Waste<br /><br />a)	Grease Trap servicing<br /><br />TERM OF AGREEMENT<br /><br />The term of the Contract will be for two (2) years and will commence on 1 February 2027 through to 31 January 2029. Subject to satisfactory performance and at the sole discretion of Council, Council has the option to extend the agreement by three (3) further periods of twelve (12) months each.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Rockhampton Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532474<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies, Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
