<item><title>TEN16854 - Stage 1B of the Rockhampton Cricket Ground Irrigation Pump Station Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Rockhampton Regional Council is seeking construction tenders for the design & construct (D&C), supply and installation of the new irrigation pump station at the Rockhampton Cricket Ground (RCG).<br /><br />•	The Stage 1B works form part of the broader irrigation upgrade program, with the Stage 1A irrigation mainline already installed.<br /><br />Rockhampton Regional Council is progressing a major upgrade of the Rockhampton Cricket Ground (RCG) irrigation system as part of a multi year improvement program. The works are intended to modernise the site’s water infrastructure, improve system performance, and increase operational efficiency across the broader multisport precinct.<br /><br />Stage 1B of the proposed overhaul includes the installation of a new 230,000 litre corrugated steel water tank and an associated irrigation pump station. <br /><br />This new infrastructure will provide the storage capacity and pumping capability required to irrigate multiple fields simultaneously, significantly improving:<br /...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Rockhampton Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532476<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
