<item><title>Sport and Recreation Tree Maintenance Services Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tamworth Regional Council is seeking to establish an open panel of suitably qualified arboricultural contractors to undertake reactive, emergency and planned tree management services across Council's parks, streetscapes, facilities and other Council-owned or managed land.<br /><br />The panel will operate as an open panel arrangement for an initial term of 12 months.<br /><br /> Multiple contractors may be appointed, with work allocated at Council's discretion based on availability, capability, performance and value for money.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Tamworth Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533600<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Amos Fenn Email: a.fenn@tamworth.nsw.gov.au Tel: 0267675038<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
