<item><title>1582-2026Q RFQ - Roads Data Condition Survey Audit</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council seeks to appoint a suitably experienced Consultant to undertake a systematic field-based inspection of all road assets within the Banyule municipality as identified in the project asset register and SSA layers. The Consultant shall verify the accuracy of current road and associated asset data, collect the required inventory attributes, assess asset condition, identify defects and estimate remaining useful life where applicable. The Consultant shall use Council’s Road Inspection and Assessment Manual 2025 as the primary technical reference for asset identification, attributes, inspection and condition assessment.<br /><br />The successful Consultant shall submit details of its proposed methodology, data collection platform, quality assurance procedures, staff qualifications and proposed approach to the project deliverables as part of its quotation/ tender response.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Banyule City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Dec/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532937<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
