<item><title>Design and Construction of Dog and Duck Bridge</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Forbes Shire Council (Council) invites tenders to appoint one suitably experienced and qualified party capable of delivering the design and construction of a bridge over the existing Dog and Duck Floodway located on Wirrinya Road approximately 9km south of Forbes at Bundaburrah Creek. The project is funded through the NSW Government Regional Transport Resilience Fund and seeks to improve the resilience, safety and serviceability of the existing crossing. The project has completed environmental assessment and hydraulic investigations and is considered ready to proceed to detailed design and construction.<br /><br />The Contractor shall be responsible for the detailed design, certification and construction of the bridge structure in accordance with the Specification.<br /><br />There is a non-mandatory pre-lodgment site meeting at 10:30 AM on Thursday, 26 November 2026 at Wirrinya Road, 6.1 km’s south of the Newell Hwy<br /><br />(33°27'5.52"S, 147°57'57.58"E). Please contact Council's Nominated Contact Person ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Forbes Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533563<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
