<item><title>Learner Logbook Solution</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The core objectives of this procurement activity are to select and engage a suitably qualified supplier and offer to deliver a future Learner Logbook (LLB) solution. Delivering the future Learner Logbook solution provides an opportunity to improve the experience of Queensland learner drivers and driver instructors, which forms part of the Queensland Government's commitment to become Australia's most customer-focused government.<br /><br />The new LLB solution will include a contemporary and accessible user experience on a secure, mobile device application on both Apple IOS and Android operating systems. The Department is seeking a solution that improves on the current in-use application experience for learner driver and supervisor users and department level 1 support admin users. The Department is seeking long-term value for money while delivering a modern, secure, positive and accessible user experience. Further details on what the Department is seeking are in the below in scope, and in the enclosed CDSB1 Re...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Customer, Data and Small Business (CDSB)<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Jan/2027 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531544<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 21]]></description>
