<item><title>RFQ - Furniture, Fixtures and Equipment (FF&amp;E)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Whiddon is seeking to establish a consistent Furniture, Fixtures and Equipment (FF&E) design and product standard that will guide the selection of FF&E across future developments, refurbishments and replacement programs.<br /><br />As the initial opportunity under this approach, Whiddon is seeking proposals for the design, selection and supply of FF&E for the new Whiddon Temora development. The selected solution should establish a foundation that can be applied and adapted across future Whiddon environments.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Whiddon<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Dec/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533396<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Affan Shoaib Email: a.shoaib@whiddon.com.au Tel: 02 98276652<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Furniture & Furnishings, Office Related Supplies & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
