<item><title>CN-27576 - TIC-CO - North Coast DRFA 25HNO – Slope Remediation Package 2</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads, North Coast Region, is seeking proposals for CN-27576 North Coast DRFA 25HNO – Slope Remediation Package 2 which involves remediation of several minor and major slope failures on Kilcoy-Beerwah Road (RD 492) and Woombye Montville Road (RD 498).<br /><br />Contractors with TMR prequalification Major R3, Minor A2 and Financial F25 and above are invited to tender.<br /><br />Tenderers are advised the Queensland Code and Guidelines apply to this tender. <br /><br />Only TMR prequalified eligible tenderers will be given access to the Tender Documents via the QBuild eTender website: https://etender.hpw.qld.gov.au/. Prequalified tenderers are to email NC_Procurement_Inbox@tmr.qld.gov.au to gain access to the tender documents.<br /><br />Note: Due to an undeliverable message some users are experiencing, please type the email address into your email rather than using the copy and paste function.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads-North Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533386<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
