<item><title>Request for Tender: High-Pressure Cleaning Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Woollahra Municipal Council invites suitably qualified and experienced contractors to submit a Tender for the provision of High-Pressure Cleaning Services.<br /><br />The Contract involves the delivery of high-pressure cleaning services across Council-owned and managed assets, including business centres, public domain areas, parks and other Council facilities. The successful Contractor will be required to provide programmed annual cleaning services, as well as urgent and emergency response services as required.<br /><br />The initial term will be 3 years, with an option to extend for a further 1 + 1 years at Woollahra Council’s sole discretion.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Woollahra Municipal Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Dec/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533335<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
