<item><title>RFQ260264 Assessment of Central Highlands Regional Council Washdown Facilities</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Review each of the 4 Council washdown facilities across the Central Highlands, determine its condition, understand how much they are utilised now and likely to be used in the future, identify any upgrades required, and recommend where washdown facilities should be located to best support Council operations, biosecurity requirements and regional industries all when considering the legislative obligations by Council.<br /><br />All 4 reviews to by submitted to Council by 10 May 2027.<br /><br />The washdown facilities are located within the region at Duaringa, Emerald, Rolleston and Springsure.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533238<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Business & Administrative Services, Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Environmental & Heritage Services, Financial & Insurance Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
