<item><title>T031-2026-27 Williamtown Drain Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Scope of Works defines targeted drain maintenance and minor improvements to existing channels south of RAAF Base Williamtown, in the vicinity of Cabbage Tree Road, Nelson Bay Road and Fullerton Cove. The works comprise vegetation clearing; removal of localised sediment high points, lumps and choke points; localised excavation only where nominated; and improvement of the existing connector crossing. The works shall not create new drainage systems or materially alter drain geometry.<br /><br />Tenderers are required to attend a mandatory pre-tender site meeting. The meeting will be held in the road reserve area in Fullerton Cove Rd near the intersection with Nelson Bay Rd, to the north of 492 Fullerton Cove Rd at 9am Thursday 19th November 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Port Stephens Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533259<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 30]]></description>
