<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>Development of Cemetery Strategy</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mackay Regional Council invites tenders from suitably qualified and experienced consultants for the development of a Cemetery Strategy for the Mackay Region 2026-2036 under Contract No. MRC-2027-CONA-000040. The project will establish a strategic framework to guide the provision and management of Cemetery Land and the delivery of cemetery services across the Mackay Regional Council area for the next ten years. <br /><br />The successful consultant will be required to undertake a comprehensive assessment of current cemetery provision, forecast future cemetery demand, prepare a series of Working Papers, and develop a Cemetery Strategy and prioritised Action Plan. Services will include stakeholder engagement, cemetery site inspections, benchmarking, presentations to Council and, where directed, a community perceptions component. <br /><br />The consultancy is anticipated to commence on 19 January 2027 and be completed by 31 May 2027. Services will be provided primarily within the Mackay Regional Council Local Go...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mackay Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Dec/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533276<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
