<guid isPermaLink="false">a680e133949b4c9abd079040ebf461a0</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 04:45:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
<category>ELEC, Lighting, Equip &amp; Services</category>
</item>
<item><title>RFT 2627-23 Safety, Compliance and Discretionary Training Services Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking to establish a panel of suitably qualified providers to deliver Safety, Compliance and Discretionary Training Services across four categories: First Aid and CPR, Manual Handling, Mandatory Compliance Training and Discretionary Training. Services may be delivered face-to-face, virtually, through eLearning or blended learning, on an as-required basis.<br /><br />Panel establishment is anticipated to commence in March 2027. Delivery may occur across Council locations, metropolitan or regional locations where required, and remotely through virtual/eLearning delivery.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Greater Dandenong<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533280<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Training & Development<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
