<item><title>Owen Jenkins Park Sarina Beach Public Amenities</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mackay Regional Council invites tenders from suitably qualified contractors for the construction of new public amenities at Owen Jenkins Park, Sarina Beach, including associated civil, landscaping, wastewater infrastructure and demolition works.<br /><br />The project involves the installation of a new fully accessible amenities building, wastewater treatment and effluent dispersal infrastructure, pedestrian access connections, landscaping and site rehabilitation works. The contract also includes demolition of the existing public toilet facility and associated structures, restoration of disturbed areas, and all associated construction, certification and commissioning requirements.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mackay Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Dec/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533231<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
