<item><title>Provision of Domestic and Family Violence Specialist Court Reception Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Justice (the Customer) is seeking one or more suitable Service Providers to deliver Domestic and Family Violence (DFV) court reception services at the five specialist DFV courts (Southport, Beenleigh, Brisbane, Cairns, and Townsville) and one non-specialist but high-volume, focused Support Site (Ipswich).<br /><br />A key feature of the specialist DFV court model is the coordination of court matters and support services to ensure that court users can access information, legal assistance, advice and support before matters proceed for consideration by the magistrate.<br /><br />The Service Provider/s will be required to deliver trauma informed, person centred reception services that support the safe and effective operation of specialist DFV courts and DFV court lists. This includes greeting and assisting court users and stakeholders, providing a central check-in point, facilitating access to safe spaces, directing court users to appropriate specialist support services and legal representatives...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Justice<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533195<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Julieann Ramsey Email: julieann.ramsey@justice.qld.gov.au Tel: 07 3738 9234<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
