<item><title>Richmond Village Green and Playground Upgrade - Design &amp; Documentation Consultancy</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Clarence City Council (CCC) invites Quotations from suitably qualified Respondents to undertake a consultancy for the preparation of an Issue for Tender Package, including concept design, detailed design, drawings, details, schedules, specifications and supporting documentation as required under the Contract for the upgrade of the Richmond Village Green and playground at 54-56 Bridge Street, Richmond, Tasmania 7025<br /><br />The Richmond Village Green and Playground Upgrade is the first project proposed for delivery under the Richmond Village Master Plan 2026, a strategic framework adopted by the CCC in June 2026 to guide planning, investment and development within Richmond over the next 20 years.<br /><br />The Master Plan, developed and informed by engagement with residents, business and key stakeholders, establishes a vision for enhancing Richmond’s public spaces while protecting the village’s nationally significant heritage values and character. Key priorities include improvements to accessibility, pedes...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Clarence<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Dec/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Hobart time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP533012<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
