<item><title>Helen Street Footbridge – Design, Fabrication, Supply &amp; Construction Service</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Contractor shall provide a complete Design and Construct solution for the replacement of the Helen Street Footbridge superstructure, including investigation, detailed design, demolition of existing timber components, fabrication and installation of a new FRP deck and hot-dip galvanised steel balustrade system, temporary works, environmental management, certification, commissioning and project handover. The works shall be delivered in accordance with relevant Australian Standards, including AS 5100, and provide a minimum 100-year design life suitable for the coastal environment. Refer to the attached RFQ for the detailed scope.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Byron Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Dec/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532935<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 21]]></description>
