<item><title>Emerald Saleyards Labour Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council (Council) operates the Emerald Saleyards, a live livestock trading and handling facility supporting livestock receival, sales, dipping, feeding, spelling and dispatch. Council requires reliable and competent contract labour to maintain safe and effective operations, including scheduled sale days, weekend animal welfare requirements and fluctuating livestock activity.<br /><br />This procurement is intended to supplement Council's internal and agency labour resources by providing contracted weekend livestock services, sale day scalehouse gate operations and additional operational labour as required. Council will retain operational oversight and direction through its authorised officers. Council may award individual service components or the combined scope to one or more suppliers, with no exclusivity unless expressly agreed.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532780<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Farming & Animal Services & Equip<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
