<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council, through this Request for Tender (RFT) No 2026/27-504006A is seeking the services of a suitable qualified Contractor to undertake the removal and disposal of the relevant existing HVAC heating system at Springwood Aquatic and Fitness Centre and the Supply and installation of new HVAC Heating system at Springwood Aquatic and Fitness Centre.<br /><br />Council will conduct a compulsory site inspection for tenderers to be held 10am on 19 November 2026 at Springwood Aquatic Centre.<br /><br />Council will not consider a Tender submission lodged by a Tenderer who fails to attend this briefing or fails to ensure that a representative attends on its behalf. <br /><br />Please confirm with the nominated contact your attendance at this meeting no later than 12pm on 16 November 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Blue Mountains City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530841<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Electronic Components & Supplies, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 16]]></description>
