<item><title>Standing Offer Arrangement (SOA) - Wound Care, Bandages &amp; Dressings</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Queensland Health, is undertaking an open-market Invitation to Offer (ITO) to establish a new statewide Standing Offer Arrangement (SOA) for the supply of wound care consumables across Queensland Health's 16 Hospital and Health Services (HHSs), including metropolitan, regional, rural and remote healthcare facilities.<br /><br />The scope of this procurement includes wound care dressings, bandages, compression products and associated consumables, organised into four major product categories:<br /><br />- Bandages<br /><br />- Primary Contact and Barriers<br /><br />- Alginate and Gelling Fibres<br /><br />- Foams, Hydrocolloids and Hydrogels<br /><br />The objective of this procurement is to establish a statewide arrangement that provides access to clinically suitable, fit-for-purpose wound care products, achieves value for money and supports continuity of supply across Queensland Health.<br /><br />Suppliers are invited to submit offers in accordance with the requirements outlined in the ITO documentation.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Health<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532672<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Medical Equipment. & Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
