<item><title>Request for Information - Targeted Engagement Programs (TEP)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Education (DoE) invites responses to this Request for Information (RFI) for the quality assurance assessment of suppliers seeking to provide Targeted Engagement Programs in Queensland state schools.<br /><br />The purpose of this RFI is to establish and maintain a register of pre-qualified suppliers for the delivery of Targeted Engagement Programs in Queensland state schools.<br /><br />This RFI sets out the mandatory requirements and pre-qualification criteria against which respondents will be assessed, including their capability, capacity, experience and suitability to deliver Targeted Engagement Programs.<br /><br />The RFI will remain open on an ongoing basis to allow suppliers to submit responses over time. Responses received will be assessed periodically, with assessments expected to occur quarterly. The initial assessment is scheduled to commence late Quarter 4, 2026 with the preferred supplier list to be published for schools to access in Semester 1, 2027.<br /><br />These assessment...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Education<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 31/Dec/2028 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531535<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
