<item><title>TRC000564 Preferred supplier arrangement for Flood Risk Management and Stormwater Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council invites offer from suitably qualified consultants for appointment to the preferred supplier arrangement for Flood Risk Management and Stormwater Services panel. Council is seeking to establish this panel to provide additional specialist capability and capacity to support its in-house staff in the planning and delivery of projects across the service categories described.<br /><br />The panel will enable Council to efficiently engage suitably qualified consultants when supplementary resources, specialist expertise or independent professional advice are required. Engagements may include support for discrete projects, programs of work, technical investigations, modelling, strategic planning, policy development, peer review and other flood risk management or stormwater planning requirements.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532675<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
