<item><title>T27018 - Stonnington Depot – Amenities and Multi-purpose Room Refurbishment</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> T27018 - Stonnington Depot – Amenities and Multi-purpose Room Refurbishment<br /><br />Tenderers are invited for the refurbishment of Stonnington Depot’s front of house amenities and multi-purpose room.<br /><br />The works include the refurbishment of the Stonnington Depot’s female and male toilet amenities and multi-purpose room to provide modern, functional and accessible facilities. The scope generally includes demolition, new fixtures and finishes, joinery, plumbing, electrical and associated building services.<br /><br />A non-mandatory tender briefing will be held on Tuesday 17 November 2026 10:00am. Please refer to the documents for further details.<br /><br />NOTE: The Vendor Panel online forum closes five business days prior to the abovementioned tender closing date. Council reserves the right not to accept the lowest or any Tender, or part thereof. Tenders received after the closing time will not be considered.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Stonnington<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532332<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 16]]></description>
