<item><title>T27019 - Grattan Gardens Extension</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> T27019 - Grattan Gardens Extension<br /><br />Tenders are invited for the construction works to deliver a public space that will promote a connection between Izett St Park and Grattan Gardens.<br /><br />This project includes the construction of a pedestrian crossing through the laneway to facilitate a safe circulation of pedestrians through these spaces. Key objectives and outcomes include:<br /><br />•	New paving.<br /><br />•	Seating and seating walls.<br /><br />•	New garden beds and high-quality horticulture.<br /><br />•	Lawn areas.<br /><br />•	New public and decorative lighting.<br /><br />The scope includes the construction of the new open space including:<br /><br />•	Demolition works and fence removal.<br /><br />•	Earth works.<br /><br />•	Drainage and irrigation.<br /><br />•	High-quality paving and seatings walls.<br /><br />•	Garden bed preparation, planting, and turf.<br /><br />•	Electrical works.<br /><br />•	Pedestrian crossing.<br /><br />Please refer to the documents for further details.<...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Stonnington<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532307<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Horticulture & Arboriculture, Railway, Tramway and Track<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
