<category>Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.</category>
</item>
<item><title>FOGO Marketing, Engagement, Education and Behaviour Change Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> MidCoast Council invites tenders from suitably qualified consultants to design, develop, deliver and evaluate a comprehensive Food Organics and Garden Organics (FOGO) marketing, engagement, education and behaviour change campaign.<br /><br />The successful Consultant will translate Council’s Education and Behaviour Change Strategy and Plan Framework into a coordinated campaign that helps residents understand the new service, prepare for its introduction and correctly separate food and garden organics.<br /><br />Services include community research and audience analysis; behaviour change and campaign planning; creative development and message testing; production of accessible content and reusable engagement materials; media planning and buying; community outreach and face-to-face engagement; launch support; ongoing reinforcement; and evaluation and handover.<br /><br />Tenderers must propose the quantities, formats, frequency, coverage and resources for each deliverable for Council’s assessment, supported by p...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> MidCoast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Dec/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531174<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Advertising and Media Services, Marketing & Communications<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
