<item><title>CTOS026 - 26/27 - Brolga Theatre Fire Hydrant Pipe Renewal</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> OVERVIEW<br /><br />Fraser Coast Regional Council is inviting offers from suitably qualified and experienced Tenderers for CTOS026 - 26/27 - Brolga Theatre Fire Hydrant Pipe Renewal project.<br /><br />The pipework throughout the internal spaces of the facility is end of life and need replacement to the design and specification attached to this ITO. <br /><br />The delivery timeframe of this project is to align with a planned shutdown period for the facility, 1st January 2027 to 17th March 2027.<br /><br />The outcome is to have a reliable fire hydrant system asset to see the community facility compliant with the standards for the foreseeable future. <br /><br /><br />MANDATORY TENDER BRIEFING<br /><br />A Tender Briefing is Mandatory for this tender. The details are outlined below:<br /><br />Date: Tuesday, 17 November 2026<br /><br />Time: 11:00am (AEST)<br /><br />Location: Brolga Theatre; 5 Walker Street, Maryborough Queensland 4650<br /><br />Booking Required: YES<br /><br />Point of Contact for Booking:...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Fraser Coast Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Dec/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532723<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Fire & Safety, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
