<item><title>Drug and Alcohol Testing Services - QGAir</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> QGAir requires drug and alcohol testing services to support implementation of its Drug and Alcohol Management Plan (DAMP) across its fixed wing and rotary wing operations.<br /><br />The requirement covers:<br /><br />a)	alcohol breath testing and urine drug testing<br /><br />b)	sample collection, handling and chain-of-custody management<br /><br />c)	laboratory coordination and confirmatory testing<br /><br />d)	Medical Review Officer services and support where required<br /><br />e)	clinic-based and onsite testing, including urgent and after-hours response<br /><br />f)	regional, remote and temporary deployment testing arrangements<br /><br />g)	secure reporting of results and exceptions, records management and audit support<br /><br />h)	mobilisation, service coordination and performance reporting.<br /><br />Services must support pre-employment or commencement testing, routine, random and blanket testing, post-accident or serious incident testing, reasonable suspicion or reasonable grounds testing, and r...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Police Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Dec/2026 06:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532721<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Healthcare Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
