<item><title>Culvert Replacement Works - Kellys Road, Omeo Valley</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Two existing failing pipe culverts that are located along Kellys Road over minor tributaries of the Mitta Mitta River are the subject of this report. At each of the sites, an existing reinforced concrete pipe culvert has deteriorated in condition to the extent that the East Gippsland Shire Council is investigating repair or replacement works.<br /><br />An assessment of the existing sites has been carried out to determine and assess the range of options available for replacing each of the culverts. It is proposed for Site A that the existing DN1200 mm concrete pipe be replaced with single cell reinforced concrete culvert on a similar horizontal and vertical alignment as currently exists. The existing DN900 mm pipe at Site B can be repaired to a serviceable condition by re-laying the pipes at the culvert outlet.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> East Gippsland Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532404<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 20]]></description>
