<item><title>VP531999 Management Services for Lake Proserpine Holiday Park</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Whitsunday Regional Council (Council) invites suitably experienced and qualified Suppliers to submit a proposal for the management of Lake Proserpine Holiday Park, located at 66 Station Road, Lake Proserpine, Queensland 4800. The park is situated approximately 30km inland from Proserpine via Crystal Brook Road.<br /><br />The Holiday Park currently includes:<br /><br />a) 120 unpowered campsites, with a maximum capacity of 600 guests;<br /><br />b) Three (3) amenity blocks;<br /><br />c) One (1) kiosk;<br /><br />d) 12 steel fire pits;<br /><br />e) One (1) large communal steel fire pit;<br /><br />f) One (1) watercraft pontoon, usable at higher dam water levels;<br /><br />g) A recreational non-motorised water sports concession area;<br /><br />h) A sewage treatment plant; and<br /><br />i) Six (6) basic accommodation huts, known as Barra Huts, currently under construction.<br /><br />The six (6) Barra Huts will provide basic accommodation only and will not include bathroom or kitchen facilities. Each hut is...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Whitsunday Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531999<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=f75ce0da565c417790591f0b2afb7453s531999s6f595f4695fd4d68b10e17b09b3a8675s1607</link>
