<item><title>Emerald Sporting Fields Top Dressing</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council is seeking quotations from suitably qualified contractors to undertake sports field renovation works at nominated sporting fields within Emerald.<br /><br />The works are intended to improve turf health, alleviate soil compaction, enhance drainage, improve playing surface quality, and support the long-term sustainability and safe use of community sporting facilities.<br /><br />The successful contractor shall provide all labour, plant, equipment, materials and supervision necessary to undertake the following:<br /><br />•	Hollow Tine Aeration (Coring) to relieve soil compaction and improve root zone performance. (All fields except McIndoe Field#3)<br /><br />•	Collection, processing and management of extracted cores where required.<br /><br />•	Supply and application of approved top dressing material.<br /><br />Central Highlands Regional Council is seeking quotations from suitably qualified contractors to undertake sports field renovation works at nominated sporting fields ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532185<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Horticulture & Arboriculture, Plant & Equipment - Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
