<category>Plant &amp; Equipment - Hire</category>
</item>
<item><title>Sunrise Way Roofing Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Darling Downs Hospital and Health Service invites offers for the provision of construction works for the Sunrise Way Roofing Replacement located at 9-13 Tourist Road, Toowoomba, Queensland in accordance with the requirements of this Request for Tender.<br /><br />The purpose of this Request for Tender is to obtain fixed lump sum pricing. A mandatory site inspection has been scheduled for Friday, 20 November 2026, see Request for Tender on instructions to nominate an organisational representative.<br /><br />The project aims to preserve and protect the heritage building & the health service it houses by replacing the deteriorated roofing materials with new, heritage approved, products. As well as the remediation of water ingress defects, restoration of heritage masonry elements, upgrade of stormwater drainage infrastructure, and repair of associated internal building damage. All works are to be delivered in strict accordance with the Heritage Exemption Certificate, approved design documentation, relevant Austr...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Darling Downs Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532055<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Environmental & Heritage Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
