<item><title>Forward Procurement Notice- Roma Street Connect</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Forward Procurement Notice (FPN) is issued on behalf of the Department of Transport and Main Roads (TMR), to publicly notify the market that TMR intends to commence procurement in the coming weeks for the Main Works Package of the Roma Street Connect (RSC) project (the Project).<br /><br />TMR is planning priority upgrades at Roma Street station through the Project.<br /><br />The proposed scope includes:<br /><br />Vertical transport capacity upgrades, including new and additional lifts and escalators between the pedestrian subway and surface-level platforms, to meet forecast demand; and accessibility upgrades to platforms.<br /><br />The Main Works Package is proposed to be procured using a construct-only delivery model under the Rail Infrastructure Contract - Construct Only (RIC-CO). Enabling works, including overhead line equipment upgrades, are proposed to be delivered separately by Queensland Rail and are not included in the scope of this package.<br /><br />The scope, staging and packaging of the ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532154<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Railway, Tramway and Track<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
