<item><title>Expression of Interest - Head Contractor - UniSC Moreton Bay Stage 3</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The University of the Sunshine Coast (UniSC or the University) invites Expressions of Interest from suitably qualified and experienced Contractors for the delivery of the Moreton Bay Stage 3 (MBS3) project at the UniSC Moreton Bay Campus.<br /><br />MBS3 comprises the construction of a new six-storey Building B1 and adaptive reuse of Building A1 Level 1, delivering additional teaching, learning, research, workplace and community-facing facilities required to support the continued growth of the Moreton Bay Campus.<br /><br />Building B1 is anticipated to be approximately 11,500m² Gross Floor Area (GFA) and will incorporate a mix of contemporary learning and teaching spaces, learning commons, staff workspaces, research and industry collaboration facilities, simulation and visualisation environments, student-focused facilities, food and beverage offerings and community-facing clinical and engagement spaces.<br /><br />Building A1 Level 1 will be refurbished and repurposed to provide specialist teaching, laborato...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> UniSC<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP532086<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
