<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Responses are being called from tenderers to provide a range of Harware Supplies including but not limited to the following categories;<br /><br />- Over the Counter and Stocked Items<br /><br />- Minor Plant<br /><br />- Battery Operated Tools<br /><br />- Hand Tools & Accessories<br /><br />- Steel<br /><br />Tenderer can apply for as many or as few categories as they like and successful tenderers will be placed on a panel of suppliers which will cover all required categories. If you are responding to a category, you are to provide pricing for all items in that category. This contract will be for an initial three (3) year period, with the option by Council to extend by a further two (2) x one (1) year extension options<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Penrith City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Dec/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531972<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies, Clothing & Safety Equipment, Construction & Operation, Fire & Safety, Fleet Servicing & Accessories, Fuel & Oils, Hardware & Hand Tools, IT & Telecomms, Plant & Equipment - Hire, Plant & Equipment - Purchase, Security Services & Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
