<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:20:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Training &amp; Development</category>
</item>
<item><title>HEPA Vacuum maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of the H Class HEPA Vacuum Maintenance Services is to support FRV in maintaining its HEPA rated vacuum equipment, ensuring compliance with safety and legal standards, safeguarding workers from hazardous dust exposure, and keeping all sites and fleet assets clean, safe, and operational. This includes preventative and corrective maintenance.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Fire Rescue Victoria<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530741<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies, Fire & Safety<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
