<item><title>ITT259 - Aquatic Supervision (Lifeguard Services) - Aura Lagoon and Parklands, Caloundra South</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited from experienced and qualified aquatic facility operators for the provision of lifeguard services, together with the day to day operational duties at an aquatic facility within Aura Parklands (Aura Lagoon), located within the Caloundra South Priority Development Area (PDA), for a fixed term of three (3) years with option to extend for two (2) further years, commencing March 2027 and expiring on March 2030.<br /><br />The aquatic facility will include all supporting infrastructure, including plant room and equipment, lifeguard tower and supervision zones, duty manager office, staff lunchroom and amenities, first aid room, storage areas, public change rooms and amenities, dedicated changing places facility, BBQ areas and shelters and water play.<br /><br />Aura Parklands and Lagoon is an exciting new “South Bank style” urban parkland destination for the Sunshine Coast, offering a wide range of attractions, leisure facilities and event spaces which is currently under construction and due for ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Dec/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531850<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services, Real Estate & Property Services, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 18]]></description>
