<item><title>CC4Teams Software Licence, Support &amp; Enhancement Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Council requires a support partner to provide licencing for cc4teams (and related call recording) and support for contact centre operations.<br /><br />The support involves:<br /><br />•	Resolution of incidents and requests related to the operation of cc4teams in Council’s Microsoft Teams telephony environment,<br /><br />•	Support for changes and improvements for the use of cc4teams by contact centre teams,<br /><br />•	Support and maintenance of PowerBI reporting and wallboards used by the contact centre operators.<br /><br />Council is seeking a suitably qualified and experienced supplier to provide cc4teams licensing, call recording licensing, support and enhancement services for its contact centre environment.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Stonnington<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531898<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
