<item><title>Design and Construct - Dalby Karingal RACF Upgrades</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Darling Downs Hospital and Health Service invites offers for the provision of design services and the provision of construction services of the resulting works for the Dalby Hospital RACF Upgrades, in accordance with the requirements of this Request for Tender.<br /><br />The purpose of this Request for Tender is to obtain fixed lump sum pricing for Separable Portion A for design services and to provide an indicative estimate only for Separable Portion B Construction.<br /><br />Value for money will be determined by reference to the demonstrated capability of offerors in delivering similar projects, their capacity to complete the construction before 30 June 2028 and other factors as set out in Request for Tender documentation.<br /><br />A site visit has been scheduled to 11 November 2026. See attached Request for Tender documents for further details.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Darling Downs Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531767<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 15]]></description>
