<item><title>Public Amenities Upgrade, Refurbishment and Replacement Program</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Livingstone Shire Council is seeking experienced building contractors to deliver its Public Amenities Upgrade, Refurbishment and Replacement Program across Yeppoon and Emu Park. The program includes the construction of new accessible amenities facilities, refurbishment of existing public amenities, demolition and replacement works, site preparation and associated civil infrastructure. <br /><br />The procurement comprises four separable portions:<br /><br />Separable Portion 1 – Kerr Park, Emu Park Site preparation, civil works, services installation and associated infrastructure works.<br /><br />Separable Portion 2 – Beaman Park, Yeppoon Refurbishment and upgrade of an existing public amenities facility.<br /><br />Separable Portion 3 – Zilzie Beach, Emu Park Demolition of the existing amenities and construction of a replacement public amenities facility.<br /><br />Separable Portion 4 – Hill Street, Yeppoon Demolition of the existing amenities and construction of a replacement public amenities facility.<br...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Livingstone Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531876<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 16]]></description>
