<item><title>2627-16 Building Maintenance Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council intends to appoint a suitably qualified and experienced service provider to deliver a broad range of planned preventative<br /><br />and reactive building maintenance services across approximately three hundred (300) Council buildings and facilities located throughout the<br /><br />municipality.<br /><br />The anticipated scope will encompass a diverse range of building services and asset types, including electrical, mechanical, fire<br /><br />protection, hydraulic, security, vertical transport, doors and access systems, kitchen and catering equipment, height safety<br /><br />systems, aquatic plant and general building fabric and associated services.<br /><br />The successful service provider will be expected to provide an integrated maintenance service incorporating preventative<br /><br />maintenance, reactive maintenance, quoted and minor capital works, statutory and compliance-related maintenance, help desk<br /><br />services, asset information management and associated reporting and contract ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Greater Dandenong<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531862<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
