<item><title>Footpath Renewal Program 2026/2027</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Town of Gawler invites submissions from Tenderers for the provision of Asphalt Footpath Renewal works in various locations in the Gawler region. <br /><br />The proposed works package comprises the following:<br /><br />- Renewal of existing asphalt footpaths and releveling of non-compliant crossfalls at the following locations:<br /><br /> - Reid Street, Gawler 5118 – From Tod Street to Moore Street (Both Sides)<br /><br /> - Tod Street, Gawler 5118 – From Reid Street to Murray Street (Northern side)<br /><br />Tenderers are also asked to submit a schedule of rates for crack sealing and patching along the South Para River Shared Path. The scope of these works will be determined based on available budget.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Town of Gawler<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+09:30) Adelaide time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531725<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Artemus Tadiar Email: artemus.tadiar@gawler.sa.gov.au Tel: 85229242<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
