<item><title>Bowen Landfill – Cell 2 – Construction Quality Assurance (CQA) Consultancy</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Whitsunday Regional Council (Council) owns and operates the Bowen Landfill, located south of Bowen in North Queensland.<br /><br />Council is developing additional waste disposal capacity at the Bowen Landfill to meet the region's long-term waste management requirements. The works involve the construction of a new engineered landfill cell incorporating a geosynthetic barrier system and leachate collection and conveyance infrastructure.<br /><br />Council proposes to engage a suitably qualified and experienced Construction Quality Assurance (CQA) Consultant to provide independent, third-party CQA services for the construction of Bowen Landfill Cell 2. The CQA Consultant must provide independent CQA monitoring, inspection, verification, documentation, testing review and recommendations to the Superintendent. The CQA Consultant is not responsible for directing the Contractors or ensuring Contractor compliance, which remains the responsibility of the relevant Contractor and the Superintendent under the constructi...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Whitsunday Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517917<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services, Environmental & Heritage Services, Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
