<item><title>Operation and Management of the Ultima Compost Facility</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking an experienced and suitably qualified operator to manage the Ultima Compost Facility and establish a financially sustainable, commercially viable and environmentally responsible composting operation.<br /><br />The successful respondent will be responsible for the receipt and processing of organic waste materials, including Council's Food Organics and Garden Organics (FOGO) kerbside collection material and green waste feedstocks. Responsibilities will include the production, marketing and sale of compost products, development of end markets, management of the Facility's day-to-day operations, and compliance with all relevant legislative, regulatory and environmental requirements.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Dec/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531375<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
