<item><title>Expression of Interest (EOI) – Moreton Bay Indoor Sports Centre Delivery Contractor</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of this Expression of Interest (EOI) is to enable Applicants to demonstrate their capability, relevant experience, delivery approach, and ability to achieve sustainability and social procurement outcomes required for the delivery of the Project. <br /><br />The EOI Documents provide details of Procurement Process, EOI Conditions, the Evaluation Process, the Principal's objectives, and key details that the Applicant needs to know to submit a conforming EOI Submission. This EOI submission will be used to establish a shortlist of Tenderers to progress to the next phase of the procurement process. <br /><br />The Applicant will need to address the physical construction of the facility, progressing from bulk earthworks through to the completed building. This includes: <br /><br />1. site preparation and bulk earthworks; <br /><br />2. substructure elements, including foundations and ground slab; <br /><br />3. superstructure, including concrete and primary framing elements; <br /><br />4. façade and ro...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Games Independent Infrastructure&Coordination Ath<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530973<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
