<item><title>2026/192 Back Creek Bridge - Design and Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Boroondara (Council) requires a suitably qualified and experienced Contractor to carry out the following works in accordance with this Request for Tender (RFT) and its attachments. Council invites the tenderer to submit a tender for the provision of the works in a Design and Construct capacity for the Back Creek Bridge project. <br /><br />The Back Creek Bridge (the Project) involves the design and construction of a new pedestrian and cyclist bridge over Back Creek. The Project also includes the potential construction of an accessible shared path to provide a continuous connection between Denman Avenue and Somerset Road in Glen Iris. The shared path will require a retaining wall along its alignment. The Project supports Council’s vision to improve community connectivity, encourage sustainable transport, and enhance safety and accessibility along the trail.<br /><br />The Back Creek Reserve in Glen Iris forms part of the broader Back Creek Trail corridor that extends north-south through the City of...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Boroondara<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 23/Nov/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529923<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=b203ad854a2a4c86911b36dcf743cabfs529923s50c818bb80c044cab1c37a23ba39eee8s1554</link>
