<item><title>Place and People Access and Functionality Upgrade Tully Admin (Dorothy Jones Library)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Request Overview<br /><br />Cassowary Coast Regional Council invites suitably qualified and experienced Respondents to submit a Tender for the Design and Construction of accessibility, functionality and customer service improvements at the Dorothy Jones Library, Tully (Contract No. CCW000437).<br /><br />The project will be delivered as a Design and Construct contract and comprises two separable portions:<br /><br />Separable Portion 1 – Internal Accessibility and Functional Upgrades<br /><br />Internal refurbishment and building alterations<br /><br />Customer Service and Library Counter upgrades<br /><br />Accessible amenities upgrades<br /><br />Fixed joinery, cabinetry and shelving<br /><br />Security, technology and building services upgrades<br /><br />Roof replacement works<br /><br />Associated demolition and refurbishment works<br /><br />Separable Portion 2 – Rear Extension<br /><br />Rear building extension<br /><br />Multipurpose Room<br /><br />Local History Room<br /><br />Store Room<br /><br />...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Cassowary Coast Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Nov/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529907<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 14]]></description>
