<item><title>Consultancy Services Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Ballina Shire Council invites Expressions of Interest (EOI) from suitably qualified and experienced consultants to provide professional consultancy services across one or more of the following categories:<br /><br />1.	Environmental consultancy services<br /><br />2.	Strategic planning services<br /><br />3.	Civil engineering services<br /><br />4.	Water and wastewater services<br /><br />5.	Project management services<br /><br />6.	Roads and traffic services<br /><br />7.	Multidisciplinary consultancy services<br /><br />Council will use this EOI process to establish a panel of prequalified consultants, shortlist providers for future procurement processes, or invite selected respondents to participate in future requests for quotation or tender processes.<br /><br />Submission of an EOI does not guarantee appointment to a panel, inclusion in future procurement processes, or the award of any work.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Ballina Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529366<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services, Environmental & Heritage Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
