<item><title>16832 - Rahima Court Sewage Pump Station Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The proposed Rahima Court Sewage Pump Station (SPS) upgrade aims to increase pumping capacity at Rahima Court SPS to support future residential development within the catchment and to enhance emergency storage capacity. Rockhampton Regional Council is inviting tenders for the upgrade construction and other components of works covered within the Scope of Works.<br /><br />Both Rahima Court SPS and the Rahima Sewer Rising Main must remain fully operational throughout the construction period to meet demand and all legislative obligations of the Rockhampton Regional Council.<br /><br />A tender level construction plan is required to be submitted as part of this tender outlining the proposed methodology for construction, which may include a Pre-Cast or Cast Insitu construction methodology.<br /><br />A single joint site inspection will be held 9.00am, 28 October 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Rockhampton Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529768<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
