<item><title>ITO - Network Hardware and Field Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The procurement will establish a contemporary replacement arrangement to ensure continuity of network hardware supply, maintenance, support and lifecycle management across CITEC’s IP-VPN, Inter-Data Centre and Point-to-Point Optical Transport services. It will replace ageing infrastructure, introduce modern technologies and network management capabilities, and maintain a reliable, resilient and scalable network environment to meet CITEC and Queensland Government agency requirements over the next five to eight years, including supporting future agency participation.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> CITEC<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523647<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Karen Grant-Taylor Email: karen.grant-taylor@citec.qld.gov.au Tel: 07 3034 2059<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
